<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>7.9.5: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01882</md:content-id>
    <md:title>7.9.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>2a58e0a0-4de4-49b0-9560-5659a3bab8d8</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para class="os-raise-text-bold"><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have
    learned in this lesson.</emphasis></para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>Choose the standard form of the quadratic expression.</item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
    <item> \((x+4)(x-1)\)</item>
  </list></list>
<list>
  <list>
    <list>
      <item> \(x^2+3x-4\) </item>
      <item> \(x^2-3x+4\) </item>
      <item> \(-x^2+3x-4\) </item>
      <item> \(-x^2-3x+4\) </item>
    </list>
  </list>
</list><para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(x^2+3x-4\) </para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
    <item> \((2x-1)(3x-1)\) </item>
  </list></list>
<list>
  <list>
    <list>
      <item> \(6x^2-5x+1\) </item>
      <item> \(6x^2+5x-1\) </item>
      <item> \(-6x^2-5x+1\) </item>
      <item> \(-6x^2+5x-1\) </item>
    </list>
  </list>
</list><para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(6x^2-5x+1\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>Consider the expression \(8-6x+x^2\). </item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
    <item>Is the expression in standard form? </item>
  </list><para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> No </para>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
    <item> Is the expression equivalent to \((x-4)(x-2)\)? </item>
  </list><para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> Yes</para>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>Find the the standard form of the quadratic expression \((x-2)(x+8)\). Use the standard form to answer questions
    a, b, and c. </item>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
    <item> What is the value of \(a\) in this expression \(ax^2+bx+c\)? </item>
  </list><para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(1\) </para>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
    <item> What is the value of \(b\) in this expression \(ax^2+bx+c\)? </item>
  </list><para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(6\) </para>
</list>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
    <item> What is the value of \(c\) in this expression \(ax^2+bx+c\)? </item>
  </list><para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(– 16\)</para>
</list></section>
</content>
